      "content": "thanks. that look pretty good and accurate. i think the attending will appreciate the nuance about the CT and the shadowing.\n\nactually, looking at the score, 0 might be a bit too low for him. he usually wants the summary to feel 'decisive' even if things are a bit murky. could you try a version that's a bit more assertive regarding the main diagnosis? like, make it sound more definitive that this is pancreatitis, even with that duodenum ambiguity. just don't overdo the fluff, keep it professional.",
